1
00:00:00,388 --> 00:00:02,058
(Sheldon:)And I'm not?

2
00:00:02,056 --> 00:00:05,226
(rumbling)

3
00:00:05,226 --> 00:00:06,426
(gasps)
It's an earthquake.

4
00:00:06,427 --> 00:00:07,727
(Sheldon:)I knew it.

5
00:00:07,729 --> 00:00:09,429
(Penny:)Sheldon, it was
just a little tremor.

6
00:00:09,430 --> 00:00:12,300
(Sheldon:)A little tremor that turns
routine sinus surgery

7
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,200
(Sheldon:)into a frontal
lobotomy.

8
00:00:17,772 --> 00:00:20,072
(Sheldon:)Oh, I don't care
for this at all.

9
00:00:20,074 --> 00:00:22,974
(Sheldon:)Oh, I need to
see he's okay.

10
00:00:22,977 --> 00:00:24,607
(Amy:)Sheldon, you can't
go back there.

11
00:00:24,612 --> 00:00:26,412
Try and stop me!

12
00:00:26,414 --> 00:00:27,514
(thud)

13
00:00:28,483 --> 00:00:30,283
(Amy:)Are you okay?

14
00:00:30,285 --> 00:00:32,315
Why didn't you stop me?!

15
00:00:35,256 --> 00:00:36,986
(Bernadette:)Can I tell you
something?

16
00:00:36,991 --> 00:00:39,261
(Bernadette:)This whole thing
with Raj's parents

17
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:41,930
(Bernadette:)just got me
a little worried about us.

18
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:44,260
(Howard:)What are you talking about?
We're fine.

19
00:00:44,265 --> 00:00:45,435
(Howard:)And Raj's parents

20
00:00:45,433 --> 00:00:48,433
(Howard:)probably split up
because of Raj.

21
00:00:48,436 --> 00:00:50,266
What?!

22
00:00:50,271 --> 00:00:52,941
(Howard:)They always say the children
aren't to blame, but...

23
00:00:52,941 --> 00:00:55,541
(laughing):
Come on.

24
00:00:58,279 --> 00:01:00,309
(Bernadette:)I'm not joking, Howie.

